\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}mantle\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8MantleModel}_S(\\mathbb M,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S(\\mathbb M,M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}mantle\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8MantleModel}_S(\\mathbb M,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S(\\mathbb M,M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是规范二元 mantle 谓词的命名兼容层；ground 的强迫见证与环境模型参数由上游定义统一处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-geology-mantle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb416e45accee42f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-geology-mantle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-geology-mantle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb416e45accee42f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S$（见 [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-geology-mantle.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb M,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8MantleModel}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}mantle\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8MantleModel}_S(\\mathbb M,M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S(\\mathbb M,M).","displ